  "prefLabel": "Env-Hw 404.02 Spill Residues and Contaminated Soil, Water, and Debris",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Hw 404.02 Spill Residues and Contaminated Soil, Water, and Debris. Any residue or contaminated soil, water, or other debris resulting from the spill or cleanup of a spill into or on any land or water of any hazardous waste or any material listed in Env-Hw 402 shall be regulated as a hazardous waste mixture in accordance with Env-Hw 401.01(b)(2).\n\nSource. #5053, eff 1-24-91; ss by #5886, eff 8-26-94; ss by #7333, eff 8-1-00; ss by #9215, INTERIM, eff 8-1-08; ss by #9367, eff 1-28-09; ss by #12346, eff 8-14-17; ss by #14524, eff 2-28-26, EXPIRES: 2-28-36",
